            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koya Esau akenor, ka ikedwe lusap ka lupesur, ka ituŋa kere lukotogoke, ka ikebaren, ka iketiaŋ kere, ka ikeboro kere, luabu kotukokinite kakwap naka Kanaan; kolot acekwap anyoun kaneajai onaceke Yakob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
